{"id":"60776de69749b4df","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/363_类型化组合逻辑.md","title":"363 类型化组合逻辑","display":"363_类型化组合逻辑","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n<h1 id=\"363-类型化组合逻辑\">363 类型化组合逻辑</h1>\n<h1 id=\"1.-原始符号\">1. 原始符号</h1>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}\">\\(\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}\\)</span>。固定可数无限变量集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Var}=\\{x_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\">\\(\\mathsf{Var}=\\{x_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\)</span> 与可数基本类型集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Base}\">\\(\\mathsf{Base}\\)</span>。组合子名集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Comb}_{TCL}=\\{K,S,I\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Comb}_{TCL}=\\{K,S,I\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"2.-类型闭包\">2. 类型闭包</h1>\n<p>类型集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ty}_{TCL}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ty}_{TCL}\\)</span> 是满足下列子句的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\\in\\mathsf{Base}\">\\(b\\in\\mathsf{Base}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{base}(b)\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_{TCL}\">\\(\\operatorname{base}(b)\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_{TCL}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_{TCL}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_{TCL}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{arr}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_{TCL}\">\\(\\operatorname{arr}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_{TCL}\\)</span>，显示为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\to B\">\\(A\\to B\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>定义声明集合与上下文集合：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Decl}_{TCL}=\\mathsf{Var}\\times\\mathsf{Ty}_{TCL},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Decl}_{TCL}=\\mathsf{Var}\\times\\mathsf{Ty}_{TCL},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ctx}_{TCL}\n=\n\\left\\{\n\\langle x_0:A_0,\\ldots,x_{n-1}:A_{n-1}\\rangle:\nn\\in\\mathbb N,\\ x_i\\in\\mathsf{Var},\\ A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_{TCL},\\\n\\forall i&lt;j&lt;n\\ (x_i\\ne x_j)\n\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ctx}_{TCL}\n=\n\\left\\{\n\\langle x_0:A_0,\\ldots,x_{n-1}:A_{n-1}\\rangle:\nn\\in\\mathbb N,\\ x_i\\in\\mathsf{Var},\\ A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_{TCL},\\\n\\forall i&lt;j&lt;n\\ (x_i\\ne x_j)\n\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{TCL}\">\\(\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{TCL}\\)</span> 定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{dom}_{TCL}(\\Gamma)=\\{x_i:i&lt;n\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{dom}_{TCL}(\\Gamma)=\\{x_i:i&lt;n\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并约定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x:A\\in\\Gamma\">\\(x:A\\in\\Gamma\\)</span> 当且仅当存在唯一 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;n\">\\(i&lt;n\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x_i=x\">\\(x_i=x\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i=A\">\\(A_i=A\\)</span>。判断形状为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash M:A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash M:A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"3.-项闭包\">3. 项闭包</h1>\n<p>项集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Tm}_{TCL}\">\\(\\mathsf{Tm}_{TCL}\\)</span> 是满足下列子句的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\">\\(x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{var}(x)\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{TCL}\">\\(\\operatorname{var}(x)\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{TCL}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_{TCL}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_{TCL}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{K}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{TCL}\">\\(\\operatorname{K}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{TCL}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_{TCL}\">\\(A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_{TCL}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{S}(A,B,C)\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{TCL}\">\\(\\operatorname{S}(A,B,C)\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{TCL}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_{TCL}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_{TCL}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{I}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{TCL}\">\\(\\operatorname{I}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{TCL}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,N\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{TCL}\">\\(M,N\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{TCL}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{app}(M,N)\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{TCL}\">\\(\\operatorname{app}(M,N)\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{TCL}\\)</span>，显示为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"MN\">\\(MN\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>类型下标是项构造子的组成部分，不是注释。</p>\n<h1 id=\"4.-自由变量与替换\">4. 自由变量与替换</h1>\n<p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"FV:\\mathsf{Tm}_{TCL}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Var})\">\\(FV:\\mathsf{Tm}_{TCL}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Var})\\)</span>：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"FV(\\operatorname{var}(x))=\\{x\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[FV(\\operatorname{var}(x))=\\{x\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"FV(\\operatorname{K}(A,B))=FV(\\operatorname{S}(A,B,C))=FV(\\operatorname{I}(A))=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[FV(\\operatorname{K}(A,B))=FV(\\operatorname{S}(A,B,C))=FV(\\operatorname{I}(A))=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"FV(\\operatorname{app}(M,N))=FV(M)\\cup FV(N).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[FV(\\operatorname{app}(M,N))=FV(M)\\cup FV(N).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统没有绑定构造子，绑定变量函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{TCL}:\\mathsf{Tm}_{TCL}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Var})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{TCL}:\\mathsf{Tm}_{TCL}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Var})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{TCL}(\\operatorname{var}(x))=\n\\operatorname{BV}_{TCL}(\\operatorname{K}(A,B))=\n\\operatorname{BV}_{TCL}(\\operatorname{S}(A,B,C))=\n\\operatorname{BV}_{TCL}(\\operatorname{I}(A))=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{TCL}(\\operatorname{var}(x))=\n\\operatorname{BV}_{TCL}(\\operatorname{K}(A,B))=\n\\operatorname{BV}_{TCL}(\\operatorname{S}(A,B,C))=\n\\operatorname{BV}_{TCL}(\\operatorname{I}(A))=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{TCL}(\\operatorname{app}(M,N))=\n\\operatorname{BV}_{TCL}(M)\\cup\\operatorname{BV}_{TCL}(N).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{TCL}(\\operatorname{app}(M,N))=\n\\operatorname{BV}_{TCL}(M)\\cup\\operatorname{BV}_{TCL}(N).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>替换函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{TCL}:\\mathsf{Tm}_{TCL}\\times\\mathsf{Var}\\times\\mathsf{Tm}_{TCL}\\to\\mathsf{Tm}_{TCL}\">\\(\\operatorname{Sub}_{TCL}:\\mathsf{Tm}_{TCL}\\times\\mathsf{Var}\\times\\mathsf{Tm}_{TCL}\\to\\mathsf{Tm}_{TCL}\\)</span> 定义为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{var}(y)[x:=N]=\n\\begin{cases}\nN,&amp;y=x,\\\\\n\\operatorname{var}(y),&amp;y\\ne x,\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{var}(y)[x:=N]=\n\\begin{cases}\nN,&amp;y=x,\\\\\n\\operatorname{var}(y),&amp;y\\ne x,\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{K}(A,B)[x:=N]=\\operatorname{K}(A,B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{K}(A,B)[x:=N]=\\operatorname{K}(A,B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{S}(A,B,C)[x:=N]=\\operatorname{S}(A,B,C),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{S}(A,B,C)[x:=N]=\\operatorname{S}(A,B,C),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{I}(A)[x:=N]=\\operatorname{I}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{I}(A)[x:=N]=\\operatorname{I}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{app}(M_0,M_1)[x:=N]=\\operatorname{app}(M_0[x:=N],M_1[x:=N]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{app}(M_0,M_1)[x:=N]=\\operatorname{app}(M_0[x:=N],M_1[x:=N]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该项语言没有绑定构造子，故</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_\\alpha^{TCL}\n=\\{(M,M):M\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{TCL}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\equiv_\\alpha^{TCL}\n=\\{(M,M):M\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{TCL}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"5.-类型规则\">5. 类型规则</h1>\n<p>变量规则为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac{x:A\\in\\Gamma}{\\Gamma\\vdash \\operatorname{var}(x):A}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac{x:A\\in\\Gamma}{\\Gamma\\vdash \\operatorname{var}(x):A}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>组合子常元规则为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac{}{\\Gamma\\vdash \\operatorname{K}(A,B):A\\to(B\\to A)},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac{}{\\Gamma\\vdash \\operatorname{K}(A,B):A\\to(B\\to A)},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac{}{\\Gamma\\vdash \\operatorname{S}(A,B,C):(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C))},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac{}{\\Gamma\\vdash \\operatorname{S}(A,B,C):(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C))},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac{}{\\Gamma\\vdash \\operatorname{I}(A):A\\to A}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac{}{\\Gamma\\vdash \\operatorname{I}(A):A\\to A}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>应用规则为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash M:A\\to B\\quad \\Gamma\\vdash N:A}{\\Gamma\\vdash \\operatorname{app}(M,N):B}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash M:A\\to B\\quad \\Gamma\\vdash N:A}{\\Gamma\\vdash \\operatorname{app}(M,N):B}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-规约规则\">6. 规约规则</h1>\n<p>根规约关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\to^0_{TCL}\\subseteq\\mathsf{Tm}_{TCL}\\times\\mathsf{Tm}_{TCL}\">\\(\\to^0_{TCL}\\subseteq\\mathsf{Tm}_{TCL}\\times\\mathsf{Tm}_{TCL}\\)</span> 由三族生成：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Red}_{K}\n=\n\\{(\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{K}(A,B),X),Y),X):\nA,B\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_{TCL},\\ X,Y\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{TCL}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Red}_{K}\n=\n\\{(\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{K}(A,B),X),Y),X):\nA,B\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_{TCL},\\ X,Y\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{TCL}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Red}_{S}\n=\n\\{(\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{S}(A,B,C),X),Y),Z),\n\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{app}(X,Z),\\operatorname{app}(Y,Z))):\nA,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_{TCL},\\ X,Y,Z\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{TCL}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Red}_{S}\n=\n\\{(\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{S}(A,B,C),X),Y),Z),\n\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{app}(X,Z),\\operatorname{app}(Y,Z))):\nA,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_{TCL},\\ X,Y,Z\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{TCL}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Red}_{I}\n=\n\\{(\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{I}(A),X),X):A\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_{TCL},\\ X\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{TCL}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Red}_{I}\n=\n\\{(\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{I}(A),X),X):A\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_{TCL},\\ X\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{TCL}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\to^0_{TCL}=\\mathsf{Red}_{K}\\cup\\mathsf{Red}_{S}\\cup\\mathsf{Red}_{I}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\to^0_{TCL}=\\mathsf{Red}_{K}\\cup\\mathsf{Red}_{S}\\cup\\mathsf{Red}_{I}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义类型化组合项一孔上下文 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{RedCtx}_{TCL}\">\\(\\mathsf{RedCtx}_{TCL}\\)</span> 为满足下列子句的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{hole}_{TCL}\\in\\mathsf{RedCtx}_{TCL}\">\\(\\operatorname{hole}_{TCL}\\in\\mathsf{RedCtx}_{TCL}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\in\\mathsf{RedCtx}_{TCL}\">\\(C\\in\\mathsf{RedCtx}_{TCL}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{TCL}\">\\(P\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{TCL}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{appL}_{TCL}(C,P)\\in\\mathsf{RedCtx}_{TCL}\">\\(\\operatorname{appL}_{TCL}(C,P)\\in\\mathsf{RedCtx}_{TCL}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{TCL}\">\\(P\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{TCL}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\in\\mathsf{RedCtx}_{TCL}\">\\(C\\in\\mathsf{RedCtx}_{TCL}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{appR}_{TCL}(P,C)\\in\\mathsf{RedCtx}_{TCL}\">\\(\\operatorname{appR}_{TCL}(P,C)\\in\\mathsf{RedCtx}_{TCL}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>填孔函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{plug}_{TCL}:\\mathsf{RedCtx}_{TCL}\\times\\mathsf{Tm}_{TCL}\\to\\mathsf{Tm}_{TCL}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{plug}_{TCL}:\\mathsf{RedCtx}_{TCL}\\times\\mathsf{Tm}_{TCL}\\to\\mathsf{Tm}_{TCL}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>由下列子句定义：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{plug}_{TCL}(\\operatorname{hole}_{TCL},M)=M,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{plug}_{TCL}(\\operatorname{hole}_{TCL},M)=M,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{plug}_{TCL}(\\operatorname{appL}_{TCL}(C,P),M)\n=\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{plug}_{TCL}(C,M),P),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{plug}_{TCL}(\\operatorname{appL}_{TCL}(C,P),M)\n=\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{plug}_{TCL}(C,M),P),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{plug}_{TCL}(\\operatorname{appR}_{TCL}(P,C),M)\n=\\operatorname{app}(P,\\operatorname{plug}_{TCL}(C,M)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{plug}_{TCL}(\\operatorname{appR}_{TCL}(P,C),M)\n=\\operatorname{app}(P,\\operatorname{plug}_{TCL}(C,M)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>一步规约定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\to_{TCL}\n=\\{(\\operatorname{plug}_{TCL}(C,M),\\operatorname{plug}_{TCL}(C,N)):\nC\\in\\mathsf{RedCtx}_{TCL},\\ M\\to^0_{TCL}N\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\to_{TCL}\n=\\{(\\operatorname{plug}_{TCL}(C,M),\\operatorname{plug}_{TCL}(C,N)):\nC\\in\\mathsf{RedCtx}_{TCL},\\ M\\to^0_{TCL}N\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>有限规约对象集合定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{RedDer}_{TCL}\n=\n\\{(M_0,\\ldots,M_{n-1}):n&gt;0,\\ \\forall i&lt;n\\ (M_i\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{TCL}),\\\n\\forall i+1&lt;n\\ (M_i\\to_{TCL}M_{i+1})\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{RedDer}_{TCL}\n=\n\\{(M_0,\\ldots,M_{n-1}):n&gt;0,\\ \\forall i&lt;n\\ (M_i\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{TCL}),\\\n\\forall i+1&lt;n\\ (M_i\\to_{TCL}M_{i+1})\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\to^*_{TCL}N\">\\(M\\to^*_{TCL}N\\)</span> 当且仅当存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho\\in\\mathsf{RedDer}_{TCL}\">\\(\\rho\\in\\mathsf{RedDer}_{TCL}\\)</span> 首项为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 且末项为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\">\\(N\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"7.-推导对象\">7. 推导对象</h1>\n<p>定义判断集合</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Jud}_{TCL}=\\{(\\Gamma,M,A):\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{TCL},M\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{TCL},A\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_{TCL}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Jud}_{TCL}=\\{(\\Gamma,M,A):\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{TCL},M\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{TCL},A\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_{TCL}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>类型规则关系为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{type}\n=\n\\mathsf{VarRule}_{TCL}\\cup\\mathsf{KRule}_{TCL}\\cup\\mathsf{SRule}_{TCL}\\cup\\mathsf{IRule}_{TCL}\\cup\\mathsf{AppRule}_{TCL},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{type}\n=\n\\mathsf{VarRule}_{TCL}\\cup\\mathsf{KRule}_{TCL}\\cup\\mathsf{SRule}_{TCL}\\cup\\mathsf{IRule}_{TCL}\\cup\\mathsf{AppRule}_{TCL},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{VarRule}_{TCL}=\\{(\\langle\\rangle,(\\Gamma,\\operatorname{var}(x),A)):\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{TCL},\\ x:A\\in\\Gamma\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{VarRule}_{TCL}=\\{(\\langle\\rangle,(\\Gamma,\\operatorname{var}(x),A)):\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{TCL},\\ x:A\\in\\Gamma\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{KRule}_{TCL}=\\{(\\langle\\rangle,(\\Gamma,\\operatorname{K}(A,B),A\\to(B\\to A))):\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{TCL},\\ A,B\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_{TCL}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{KRule}_{TCL}=\\{(\\langle\\rangle,(\\Gamma,\\operatorname{K}(A,B),A\\to(B\\to A))):\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{TCL},\\ A,B\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_{TCL}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{SRule}_{TCL}=\\{(\\langle\\rangle,(\\Gamma,\\operatorname{S}(A,B,C),(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)))):\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{TCL},\\ A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_{TCL}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{SRule}_{TCL}=\\{(\\langle\\rangle,(\\Gamma,\\operatorname{S}(A,B,C),(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)))):\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{TCL},\\ A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_{TCL}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{IRule}_{TCL}=\\{(\\langle\\rangle,(\\Gamma,\\operatorname{I}(A),A\\to A)):\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{TCL},\\ A\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_{TCL}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{IRule}_{TCL}=\\{(\\langle\\rangle,(\\Gamma,\\operatorname{I}(A),A\\to A)):\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{TCL},\\ A\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_{TCL}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{AppRule}_{TCL}=\\{(\\langle(\\Gamma,M,A\\to B),(\\Gamma,N,A)\\rangle,(\\Gamma,\\operatorname{app}(M,N),B)):\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{TCL},\\ M,N\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{TCL},\\ A,B\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_{TCL}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{AppRule}_{TCL}=\\{(\\langle(\\Gamma,M,A\\to B),(\\Gamma,N,A)\\rangle,(\\Gamma,\\operatorname{app}(M,N),B)):\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{TCL},\\ M,N\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{TCL},\\ A,B\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_{TCL}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>初始判断族为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{AxJdg}_{TCL}\n=\n\\{(\\Gamma,\\operatorname{var}(x),A):\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{TCL},\\ x:A\\in\\Gamma\\}\n\\cup\n\\{(\\Gamma,\\operatorname{K}(A,B),A\\to(B\\to A)):\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{TCL},\\ A,B\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_{TCL}\\}\n\\cup\n\\{(\\Gamma,\\operatorname{S}(A,B,C),(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C))):\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{TCL},\\ A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_{TCL}\\}\n\\cup\n\\{(\\Gamma,\\operatorname{I}(A),A\\to A):\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{TCL},\\ A\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_{TCL}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{AxJdg}_{TCL}\n=\n\\{(\\Gamma,\\operatorname{var}(x),A):\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{TCL},\\ x:A\\in\\Gamma\\}\n\\cup\n\\{(\\Gamma,\\operatorname{K}(A,B),A\\to(B\\to A)):\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{TCL},\\ A,B\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_{TCL}\\}\n\\cup\n\\{(\\Gamma,\\operatorname{S}(A,B,C),(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C))):\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{TCL},\\ A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_{TCL}\\}\n\\cup\n\\{(\\Gamma,\\operatorname{I}(A),A\\to A):\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{TCL},\\ A\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_{TCL}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{TreeDom}_{TCL}\n=\n\\{D\\subseteq_{\\mathrm{fin}}\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}:D\\ne\\varnothing\\land\n\\forall u\\in D\\ \\forall v\\preceq u\\ (v\\in D)\\land\n\\forall u\\in D\\ \\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\forall i\\in\\mathbb N\\\n(u^\\frown i\\in D\\iff i&lt;k)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{TreeDom}_{TCL}\n=\n\\{D\\subseteq_{\\mathrm{fin}}\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}:D\\ne\\varnothing\\land\n\\forall u\\in D\\ \\forall v\\preceq u\\ (v\\in D)\\land\n\\forall u\\in D\\ \\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\forall i\\in\\mathbb N\\\n(u^\\frown i\\in D\\iff i&lt;k)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\\in\\mathsf{TreeDom}_{TCL}\">\\(D\\in\\mathsf{TreeDom}_{TCL}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\\in D\">\\(u\\in D\\)</span>，令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{child}_{D}(u)\n=\n\\langle u^\\frown 0,\\ldots,u^\\frown(k-1)\\rangle\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{child}_{D}(u)\n=\n\\langle u^\\frown 0,\\ldots,u^\\frown(k-1)\\rangle\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k=|\\{i\\in\\mathbb N:u^\\frown i\\in D\\}|\">\\(k=|\\{i\\in\\mathbb N:u^\\frown i\\in D\\}|\\)</span>；密集孩子条件保证此列恰为全部直接子结点，且每个孩子都在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span> 内。定义规则实例关系</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{RuleInst}_{TCL}\n=\n\\left\\{\n(\\langle J_0,\\ldots,J_{k-1}\\rangle,J):\n(\\langle J_0,\\ldots,J_{k-1}\\rangle,J)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{type}\n\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{RuleInst}_{TCL}\n=\n\\left\\{\n(\\langle J_0,\\ldots,J_{k-1}\\rangle,J):\n(\\langle J_0,\\ldots,J_{k-1}\\rangle,J)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{type}\n\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Der}_{TCL}\n=\n\\left\\{\n(D,\\ell):\nD\\in\\mathsf{TreeDom}_{TCL},\\\n\\ell:D\\to\\mathsf{Jud}_{TCL},\\\n\\forall u\\in D\\,\n\\bigl((\\langle\\ell(v):v\\in\\operatorname{child}_{D}(u)\\rangle,\\ell(u))\\in\\mathsf{RuleInst}_{TCL}\\bigr)\n\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Der}_{TCL}\n=\n\\left\\{\n(D,\\ell):\nD\\in\\mathsf{TreeDom}_{TCL},\\\n\\ell:D\\to\\mathsf{Jud}_{TCL},\\\n\\forall u\\in D\\,\n\\bigl((\\langle\\ell(v):v\\in\\operatorname{child}_{D}(u)\\rangle,\\ell(u))\\in\\mathsf{RuleInst}_{TCL}\\bigr)\n\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{TCL}M:A\">\\(\\Gamma\\vdash_{TCL}M:A\\)</span> 当且仅当存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(D,\\ell)\\in\\mathsf{Der}_{TCL}\">\\((D,\\ell)\\in\\mathsf{Der}_{TCL}\\)</span> 满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\ell(\\langle\\rangle)=(\\Gamma,M,A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\ell(\\langle\\rangle)=(\\Gamma,M,A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>目标差异对象为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Delta}_{TCL}=(\\mathsf{Comb}_{TCL},\\operatorname{K},\\operatorname{S},\\operatorname{I},\\mathsf{Rule}_{type},\\to^0_{TCL}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Delta}_{TCL}=(\\mathsf{Comb}_{TCL},\\operatorname{K},\\operatorname{S},\\operatorname{I},\\mathsf{Rule}_{type},\\to^0_{TCL}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"7.1-保型替换义务\">7.1 保型替换义务</h2>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\notin\\operatorname{dom}_{TCL}(\\Gamma)\">\\(x\\notin\\operatorname{dom}_{TCL}(\\Gamma)\\)</span>，定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma,x:A\">\\(\\Gamma,x:A\\)</span> 为在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span> 末尾追加声明 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x:A\">\\(x:A\\)</span>；定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{drop}_x(\\Gamma,x:A)=\\Gamma\">\\(\\operatorname{drop}_x(\\Gamma,x:A)=\\Gamma\\)</span>。对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{TCL}\">\\(\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{TCL}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\">\\(x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_{TCL}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_{TCL}\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,N\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{TCL}\">\\(M,N\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{TCL}\\)</span>，登记未证义务：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"x\\notin\\operatorname{dom}_{TCL}(\\Gamma)\\land\n\\Gamma,x:A\\vdash_{TCL}M:B\\land\\Gamma\\vdash_{TCL}N:A\n\\Longrightarrow\\Gamma\\vdash_{TCL}\\operatorname{Sub}_{TCL}(M,x,N):B.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[x\\notin\\operatorname{dom}_{TCL}(\\Gamma)\\land\n\\Gamma,x:A\\vdash_{TCL}M:B\\land\\Gamma\\vdash_{TCL}N:A\n\\Longrightarrow\\Gamma\\vdash_{TCL}\\operatorname{Sub}_{TCL}(M,x,N):B.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该式是待独立证明的元理论义务，不是新增推理规则。五个项构造子的 raw 替换值由第 4 节逐项给定；类型下标不含项变量。</p>\n<p>固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_\\alpha=\\equiv_\\alpha^{TCL}\">\\(\\equiv_\\alpha=\\equiv_\\alpha^{TCL}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"8.-整个形式系统\">8. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<p>三个组合子规则分别是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{KRule}_{TCL}\">\\(\\mathsf{KRule}_{TCL}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{SRule}_{TCL}\">\\(\\mathsf{SRule}_{TCL}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{IRule}_{TCL}\">\\(\\mathsf{IRule}_{TCL}\\)</span> 的零前提 typed relation；应用节点是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{AppRule}_{TCL}\">\\(\\mathsf{AppRule}_{TCL}\\)</span> 的二前提关系。有限证明由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Der}_{TCL}\">\\(\\mathsf{Der}_{TCL}\\)</span> 给出，可导性由其根判断存在性给出。</p>\n<p>最终形式系统为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{TCL}=(\\mathsf{Var},\\mathsf{Base},\\mathsf{Ty}_{TCL},\\mathsf{Comb}_{TCL},\\mathsf{Tm}_{TCL},\\mathsf{Decl}_{TCL},\\mathsf{Ctx}_{TCL},\\operatorname{dom}_{TCL},FV,\\operatorname{BV}_{TCL},\\operatorname{Sub}_{TCL},\\equiv_\\alpha,\\mathsf{Jud}_{TCL},\\mathsf{AxJdg}_{TCL},\\mathsf{Rule}_{type},\\mathsf{RuleInst}_{TCL},\\mathsf{TreeDom}_{TCL},\\mathsf{Der}_{TCL},\\mathsf{Delta}_{TCL},\\mathsf{RedCtx}_{TCL},\\operatorname{plug}_{TCL},\\to^0_{TCL},\\to_{TCL},\\mathsf{RedDer}_{TCL},\\to^*_{TCL},\\vdash_{TCL}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal{TCL}=(\\mathsf{Var},\\mathsf{Base},\\mathsf{Ty}_{TCL},\\mathsf{Comb}_{TCL},\\mathsf{Tm}_{TCL},\\mathsf{Decl}_{TCL},\\mathsf{Ctx}_{TCL},\\operatorname{dom}_{TCL},FV,\\operatorname{BV}_{TCL},\\operatorname{Sub}_{TCL},\\equiv_\\alpha,\\mathsf{Jud}_{TCL},\\mathsf{AxJdg}_{TCL},\\mathsf{Rule}_{type},\\mathsf{RuleInst}_{TCL},\\mathsf{TreeDom}_{TCL},\\mathsf{Der}_{TCL},\\mathsf{Delta}_{TCL},\\mathsf{RedCtx}_{TCL},\\operatorname{plug}_{TCL},\\to^0_{TCL},\\to_{TCL},\\mathsf{RedDer}_{TCL},\\to^*_{TCL},\\vdash_{TCL}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"8.1-完成核对\">8.1 完成核对</h2>\n<p>本文给出类型下标组合子、变量、应用、自由变量、替换、类型规则关系、初始判断族、根规约、上下文闭包规约和有限类型推导。系统不含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span> 抽象、解释结构或满足关系。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"363-类型化组合逻辑","text":"363 类型化组合逻辑","level":1},{"id":"1.-原始符号","text":"1. 原始符号","level":1},{"id":"2.-类型闭包","text":"2. 类型闭包","level":1},{"id":"3.-项闭包","text":"3. 项闭包","level":1},{"id":"4.-自由变量与替换","text":"4. 自由变量与替换","level":1},{"id":"5.-类型规则","text":"5. 类型规则","level":1},{"id":"6.-规约规则","text":"6. 规约规则","level":1},{"id":"7.-推导对象","text":"7. 推导对象","level":1},{"id":"7.1-保型替换义务","text":"7.1 保型替换义务","level":2},{"id":"8.-整个形式系统","text":"8. 整个形式系统","level":1},{"id":"8.1-完成核对","text":"8.1 完成核对","level":2}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Var}=\\{x_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Base}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Comb}_{TCL}=\\{K,S,I\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Ty}_{TCL}","display":false},{"tex":"b\\in\\mathsf{Base}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{base}(b)\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_{TCL}","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_{TCL}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{arr}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_{TCL}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\to B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Decl}_{TCL}=\\mathsf{Var}\\times\\mathsf{Ty}_{TCL},","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Ctx}_{TCL}\n=\n\\left\\{\n\\langle x_0:A_0,\\ldots,x_{n-1}:A_{n-1}\\rangle:\nn\\in\\mathbb N,\\ x_i\\in\\mathsf{Var},\\ A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_{TCL},\\\n\\forall i<j<n\\ (x_i\\ne x_j)\n\\right\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{TCL}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{dom}_{TCL}(\\Gamma)=\\{x_i:i<n\\},","display":true